{"id":"04b222309e5248f2","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-continuous-apriori-universal.md","title":"Universality of Continuous A Priori Probability","display":"thm-continuous-apriori-universal — Universality of Continuous A Priori Probability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-continuous-apriori-universal","aliases":["43-thm-continuous-apriori-universal"],"display":"thm-continuous-apriori-universal — Universality of Continuous A Priori Probability","depends_on":["[[43-df-continuous-apriori]]","[[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§10.1.2, maximal semimeasure construction","source_printed_pages":"209","source_pdf_pages":"229","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-continuous-apriori-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-continuous-apriori-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-continuous-apriori-universal — Universality of Continuous A Priori Probability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1843130733da3f0\" href=\"?note=e1843130733da3f0\" title=\"43-df-continuous-apriori\">43-df-continuous-apriori</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dabe289b82d34117\" href=\"?note=dabe289b82d34117\" title=\"43-df-continuous-semimeasure\">43-df-continuous-semimeasure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.1.2, maximal semimeasure construction"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"209"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"229"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M\">\\(\\mathbf M\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1843130733da3f0\" href=\"?note=e1843130733da3f0\" title=\"43-df-continuous-apriori\">43-df-continuous-apriori</a> 的枚举混合。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dabe289b82d34117\" href=\"?note=dabe289b82d34117\" title=\"43-df-continuous-semimeasure\">43-df-continuous-semimeasure</a> 的同名符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}(\\mathbf M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}(\\mathbf M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非负加权和保持连续半测度不等式；各分量权重之和为 1。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu=m_e\">\\(\\nu=m_e\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\le2^{e+1}\\mathbf M\">\\(\\nu\\le2^{e+1}\\mathbf M\\)</span>。统一枚举给出下半可计算性。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§10.1.2, maximal semimeasure construction；印刷页 209，PDF 页 229。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-continuous-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"e1843130733da3f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-continuous-apriori]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-continuous-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"dabe289b82d34117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-continuous-apriori","status":"resolved","id":"e1843130733da3f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf M$ 是 [[43-df-continuous-apriori]] 的枚举混合。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-continuous-semimeasure","status":"resolved","id":"dabe289b82d34117","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}$ 采用 [[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]] 的同名符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}(\\mathbf M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu=m_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\le2^{e+1}\\mathbf M","display":false}],"bytes":1431,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-continuous-apriori-universal]] — Universality of Continuous A Priori Probability"}],"outgoing":["e1843130733da3f0","dabe289b82d34117"]}